t's in \"Theming and color\"? No. Hmm.\n\nWait — maybe the \"Category management screen\" is what you get when tapping the category chip in list mode with \"Add New Category\": the grid of categories IS the management screen, where you can long-press a category to edit/delete? We tried long-press Coffee in grid → just selected. But maybe long-press \"Transport\"/\"Food\" in grid shows delete? Let me try long-press Food in grid. Actually the cards might support long-press → management? Let me test now (list mode is on).\n\nAlso the category icons: the grid cards showed no icons. Maybe icons appear in the \"management screen\" but not in the picker? Hmm.\n\nLet me test long-press on grid cards. Go back to main (from history), show input, tap category chip to open grid, long-press a card."}
