othing earlier); division by zero blocked; negative saved (bug candidate).\n  - rotation while typing: input preserved? Earlier $1 survived rotation. Good.\nB. History: lazy sections - need more data. We have 3 sections now (Today, 13, 12). Could add 2-3 more via edit date to force scroll. Maybe do this.\nC. Budget sheet: mostly done. Check consistency: spent should be 67 now. Check \"Available\".\nD. Categories: add/delete tested; rename maybe; icons rejected.\n\nLet me check budget sheet consistency now (spent 67, available 33%). Open sheet."}
